<title>NORWAY: Norway 1996 first-half c/a surplus 34.3 bln crowns.</title>
<headline>Norway 1996 first-half c/a surplus 34.3 bln crowns.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's 1996 first-half current account surplus stood at 34.3 billion crowns compared with 16.1 billion in the first half of last year, Statistics Norway said on Thursday.</p>
<p>(In billions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>			Jan-June 1996	  Jan-June 1995</p>
<p> Balance		     34.3		  16.1</p>
<p> Goods/services	    46.6		  31.1</p>
<p> Interest/other    minus 12.3	  minus 15.0</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
